# Personal Knowledge Base CLI
A lightweight, production-quality command-line personal knowledge base manager built with SQLite FTS5 full-text search.

## Features
- Full-text search across all notes with relevance scoring
- Tag management for notes
- Export to Markdown, JSON, and responsive HTML
- SQLite storage with FTS5 for fast search
- Simple intuitive CLI interface

## Installation
